/*
 * Implements semantic validation for static field access on floating-point
 * types using the path operator `::`.
 *
 * Supported static fields:
 *   - init       — default NaN initializer
 *   - max        — maximum finite representable value
 *   - min        — minimum finite representable value
 *   - nan        — quiet NaN value
 *   - inf        — positive infinity
 *   - dig        — number of base-10 significant digits
 *   - mant_dig   — number of bits in the mantissa
 *   - max_10_exp — maximum base-10 exponent
 *   - min_10_exp — minimum base-10 exponent
 *   - max_exp    — maximum base-2 exponent
 *   - min_exp    — minimum base-2 exponent
 *   - epsilon    — machine epsilon for the type
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::validator::value::operator::path::float
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/validator/value/operator/path/float.yr
 * @Author(s):
 *   - Emile Cadorel <ecadorel@gmail.com>
 *
 * @Created(YYYY-MM-DD): 2026-04-22
 * @Copyright(C) 2021–2026 GNU-Ymir
 * @License
 *   ```text
